WEBVTT

00:01.020 --> 00:03.100
It's so fast!

00:04.340 --> 00:07.400
Look at how far we've come in no time at all!

00:07.610 --> 00:10.710
It really is handy to have a 
tamed monster that can fly, huh?

00:10.710 --> 00:12.850
Even if there are monsters 
all over the ground,

00:12.850 --> 00:15.230
it's no problem if you can fly.

00:15.230 --> 00:18.640
True, but our destination 
is still quite a ways off.

00:18.640 --> 00:21.290
Yeah... The map is scaled down,

00:21.290 --> 00:23.510
and I still can't see the edge of the field.

00:23.510 --> 00:26.600
We should hurry before the dungeon 
in the north gets swallowed up, too.

00:26.600 --> 00:28.840
And I'm worried about our base, too.

00:38.510 --> 00:39.510
How'd it look?

00:39.510 --> 00:41.590
Got quite a few of them out there.

00:41.590 --> 00:44.160
It's just a matter of time 
before they come after us.

00:44.160 --> 00:45.770
I thought so.

00:45.770 --> 00:47.610
Well, what should we do?

00:47.610 --> 00:50.300
There are traps throughout the cave.

00:50.300 --> 00:53.390
I'm sure we'll survive as long 
as we stay in here, but...

00:53.390 --> 00:55.040
Right, Sister.

00:55.040 --> 00:57.620
We want to repay Maple and her friends

00:57.620 --> 01:01.830
for saving us by making the 
area around the base safe.

01:01.830 --> 01:04.970
Oh! What a beautiful sentiment!

01:05.330 --> 01:09.100
Not to mention, we want 
our turn to shine, too.

01:10.000 --> 01:13.380
That's right! A good offense 
is the best defense!

01:13.740 --> 01:15.240
We agree.

01:15.240 --> 01:17.180
Let's take the initiative!

01:17.180 --> 01:19.010
All right, let's go!

01:19.260 --> 01:21.220
Yeah!

01:27.890 --> 01:29.540
Nope! We couldn't do it!

01:29.910 --> 01:31.980
Get into the hole, quickly!

01:36.260 --> 01:45.120
<b>BOFURI: </b>I <b>Don't Want </b>to <b>Get Hurt,
</b>so I'll <b>Max Out My Defense</b>.

03:03.160 --> 03:04.950
<b>BOFURI: </b>I <b>Don't Want </b>to <b>Get Hurt,
</b>so I'll <b>Max Out My Defense</b>.

03:05.430 --> 03:09.370
<b>Maxing Defense </b>and <b>New Parties</b>.

03:05.430 --> 03:10.810
Bear... Bear... Bear...

03:10.810 --> 03:11.500
There they are!

03:11.500 --> 03:13.120
[Power Share]!

03:13.500 --> 03:14.580
Tsukimi!

03:14.580 --> 03:15.750
Bear!

03:19.780 --> 03:21.370
Talk about a scary passing killer.

03:21.370 --> 03:24.260
When I see it this way, it 
looks insanely powerful.

03:25.050 --> 03:29.730
We should be getting close to where 
Sally said the dungeon would be.

03:29.730 --> 03:31.620
Hey, isn't that it?

03:33.110 --> 03:34.360
Bear!

03:36.100 --> 03:37.940
Looks like we nailed it.

03:43.360 --> 03:45.320
Clear, [Invisibility]!

03:50.050 --> 03:52.190
Are we invisible now?

03:52.190 --> 03:53.000
Yeah.

03:53.470 --> 03:57.460
But this doesn't work on all 
monsters, so be careful.

04:04.420 --> 04:05.590
This is...

04:05.880 --> 04:10.010
one of those things where they all attack 
as soon as they sense us, isn't it?

04:10.010 --> 04:11.780
Wh-What should we do?

04:11.780 --> 04:17.080
With this many, it'll be difficult 
for us to defeat all of them at once.

04:17.080 --> 04:18.320
No choice, then.

04:18.320 --> 04:20.190
Shadow, [Awaken]!

04:21.780 --> 04:24.160
Okay, Shadow! [Shadow World]!

04:28.070 --> 04:29.470
Look, Sis!

04:32.660 --> 04:34.680
We're gonna cut straight across.

04:34.680 --> 04:36.080
R-Right!

04:40.600 --> 04:43.760
There we ago. We managed 
to avoid a pointless fight.

04:45.120 --> 04:49.220
Now I feel like even if I set a trap 
for you, you'd slip right through it.

04:49.220 --> 04:51.270
You're amazing, Dread!

04:51.270 --> 04:54.220
You saved us! Thank you so much!

04:54.220 --> 04:55.580
It's cool.

04:55.580 --> 05:00.650
I'm gonna need you girls to put your 
firepower to work against the boss, after all.

05:01.250 --> 05:02.190
That said...

05:05.420 --> 05:07.120
Typical of Maple Tree, aren't they?

05:07.120 --> 05:09.030
You can say that again.

05:10.680 --> 05:12.690
Okay, time for the boss battle.

05:12.690 --> 05:15.580
Marcus, May, Yui, are you ready?

05:15.580 --> 05:17.540
Yep, all good.

05:17.540 --> 05:19.600
We're ready, too!

05:19.600 --> 05:20.790
Okay!

05:34.410 --> 05:35.680
[Earth Wall]!

05:37.020 --> 05:39.620
Be ready, you two! I'll create an opening!

05:39.620 --> 05:40.980
Please do!

05:40.980 --> 05:43.030
Shadow! [Shadow Pack]!

05:45.940 --> 05:48.130
Looks like we'll have to use magic!

05:48.130 --> 05:49.320
[Wind Cutter]!

05:55.900 --> 05:57.640
Time to use the special ball...

05:57.640 --> 05:59.290
...that Iz made for us!

06:09.090 --> 06:10.450
Now, Dread!

06:10.450 --> 06:11.680
It's all yours!

06:11.680 --> 06:13.810
The hell kinda feat of strength was that?!

06:13.810 --> 06:15.770
[Septuple Slash]!

06:18.680 --> 06:19.730
Whoa, there!

06:19.990 --> 06:22.360
May! Yui! One more shot!

06:22.590 --> 06:23.610
Okay!

06:30.440 --> 06:32.030
[Double Strike]!

06:34.870 --> 06:36.410
It survived that?!

06:36.410 --> 06:38.400
May! Yui! Get back!

06:38.400 --> 06:39.500
Marcus, it's on you!

06:45.430 --> 06:46.490
[Remote Trap]...

06:46.490 --> 06:49.130
[Earth Wall]! [Barrier]! 
[Bastion]! [Makeshift Castle]!

06:55.260 --> 06:56.760
How long will that last?

06:56.760 --> 06:59.290
At this pace, thirty seconds.

06:59.290 --> 07:01.850
That's plenty. I'll take it from here!

07:01.850 --> 07:03.190
[Super Speed]!

07:03.690 --> 07:05.520
Shadow! [Shadow Dive]!

07:05.520 --> 07:07.580
[Godspeed]! [Top Speed]!

07:09.530 --> 07:11.450
[Double Slash]!

07:17.830 --> 07:18.710
Dread!

07:18.710 --> 07:20.170
Are you all right?

07:20.170 --> 07:22.580
Yep, no problem.

07:22.580 --> 07:25.150
Oh, we got a medal.

07:26.170 --> 07:27.350
You're right!

07:27.350 --> 07:29.050
We did it, Sis!

07:29.050 --> 07:31.380
How many does that give us now?

07:31.380 --> 07:33.860
About five, I think?

07:41.660 --> 07:44.260
Looks like Dread's party 
has conquered the dungeon.

07:44.260 --> 07:45.770
Should've known, huh?

07:45.770 --> 07:49.720
And since they did it so fast, May 
and Yui must have done their part.

07:49.720 --> 07:51.610
Look, it's within sight now.

07:51.610 --> 07:54.020
Just like Sally said.

08:01.710 --> 08:04.890
Definitely looks like the 
entrance to a dungeon.

08:04.890 --> 08:07.090
Yes, there's no doubt this is the place.

08:12.000 --> 08:14.010
Looks like we went straight to the boss room.

08:14.010 --> 08:16.020
Glad that was so easy to figure out!

08:16.020 --> 08:17.350
Shall we go in?

08:17.610 --> 08:18.450
Misery...

08:18.450 --> 08:21.210
Right. If it's a trap,

08:21.210 --> 08:24.300
I'll be ready with damage 
nullification and healing.

08:24.300 --> 08:25.230
Thank you.

08:25.570 --> 08:26.760
Awaken!

08:34.020 --> 08:34.860
Just one?

08:38.010 --> 08:40.160
I see. So that's what's going on.

08:40.160 --> 08:42.980
It's the type of enemy that summons monsters.

08:42.980 --> 08:46.220
And they all probably have 
long-range attacks, too.

08:46.220 --> 08:48.670
I guess we'll have to 
go with <i>that</i> plan, then.

08:48.670 --> 08:51.390
Okay, I'll buy us some time.

08:55.030 --> 08:57.390
[High Wave]! [Magic Block]!

09:08.310 --> 09:10.440
[Large-Scale Magic Barrier]!

09:12.960 --> 09:14.230
Bell, it's your turn!

09:16.950 --> 09:18.620
[Holy Dragon Light Blade]!

09:22.060 --> 09:23.630
Ray, let's go!

09:25.120 --> 09:26.610
[Holy Spear]!

09:27.980 --> 09:30.000
Fay! [Strengthen Item]!

09:32.340 --> 09:33.630
[Tornado]!

09:36.430 --> 09:37.700
Ray! [Shooting Star]!

09:37.700 --> 09:39.600
[Sword of Judgment]!

09:50.270 --> 09:52.000
I guess our strategy won that one.

09:52.000 --> 09:55.740
Yes, and it seems we had the 
right combination of members.

09:55.740 --> 09:59.250
I got a little nervous when the 
summoned monsters suddenly multiplied,

09:59.250 --> 10:00.890
but we still managed a big win!

10:01.360 --> 10:04.330
Oh, and we've received a medal.

10:04.540 --> 10:08.290
So what now? We've still got 
some time before the sun sets.

10:08.290 --> 10:10.490
We'll try searching for the next dungeon.

10:10.490 --> 10:13.880
I'm sure the four of us could 
take on a few more of them.

10:13.880 --> 10:15.150
Yeah!

10:19.180 --> 10:21.350
That's one hell of a sandstorm.

10:21.620 --> 10:25.750
Even if there are monsters close by, we 
won't know until they're right on us.

10:25.750 --> 10:28.950
Shin, couldn't you use your [Split-Sword]?

10:28.950 --> 10:32.910
Huh? Oh, yeah. If anything's 
there, that'll detect it.

10:32.910 --> 10:35.370
I'll try it. [Split-Sword]!

10:36.350 --> 10:37.840
[Surround Formation]!

10:46.210 --> 10:48.000
It found something.

10:48.000 --> 10:50.240
I don't think it's a monster, though.

10:50.240 --> 10:52.130
Guess we'll keep moving, then.

10:52.510 --> 10:54.700
Haku, you can uncoil yourself.

10:54.700 --> 10:56.580
Snake!

11:09.180 --> 11:10.060
Is this it?

11:10.060 --> 11:12.740
Seems so. Good job, Kuromu.

11:12.740 --> 11:14.600
We finally hit the jackpot, huh?

11:14.600 --> 11:17.210
Yeah. Looks like a dungeon entrance.

11:21.360 --> 11:22.360
Hup...

11:22.360 --> 11:24.960
You can even do stuff like this?

11:25.440 --> 11:27.420
Maple gave me the hint.

11:27.420 --> 11:31.120
She taught me that skills can 
be used in all sorts of ways.

11:32.040 --> 11:33.110
Hup.

11:34.500 --> 11:36.300
Looks like we made it.

11:36.300 --> 11:37.770
There's nothing here?

11:37.770 --> 11:40.380
No, there's something in that hill of sand.

11:44.610 --> 11:46.180
Looks like those are the bosses.

11:47.930 --> 11:50.270
Earth! [Shaking Earth]!

11:54.600 --> 11:56.300
Wen! [Wind God]!

11:59.320 --> 12:01.900
Necro! [Flames of Death]!

12:03.910 --> 12:04.740
Here I go!

12:08.410 --> 12:10.260
Kasumi, be careful!

12:10.710 --> 12:12.620
Damn it! Time for my last resort!

12:12.620 --> 12:14.540
Earth! [Earth Rage]!

12:22.170 --> 12:23.680
[Split-Sword]!

12:24.170 --> 12:25.260
[Blood Blade]!

12:37.860 --> 12:39.150
They changed forms?!

12:39.400 --> 12:43.030
Fine by me! Now we can take them head-on!

12:43.290 --> 12:46.370
I'll keep them busy! The rest 
of you, finish them off!

12:46.370 --> 12:49.080
Got it! Let's start with the scorpion!

12:49.350 --> 12:53.410
Necro! [Armored: Strong]!

12:54.790 --> 12:56.330
[Provocation]!

13:00.210 --> 13:01.590
[Reflect Impact]!

13:01.590 --> 13:03.070
[Fissure]!

13:05.590 --> 13:07.040
[Split-Sword]!

13:07.040 --> 13:08.470
[Spearhead Formation]!

13:10.310 --> 13:11.810
[Arms of the Warrior]!

13:11.810 --> 13:13.530
[Second of Sword - Iron Cutter]!

13:15.730 --> 13:18.060
One left! Let's go, Shin!

13:18.060 --> 13:18.770
Right!

13:32.570 --> 13:35.250
Well, that was over quicker than I expected.

13:35.250 --> 13:38.250
What now? Wanna try to hit up one more spot?

13:38.250 --> 13:39.810
Sounds good to me.

13:39.810 --> 13:44.050
Though, with that sandstorm, we'd be 
putting Kuromu through more trouble.

13:44.050 --> 13:46.020
Hey, you just leave that to me.

13:46.020 --> 13:49.760
I'll use my great shield to split 
the sand so we can keep moving.

13:54.220 --> 13:55.640
[Commence Attack]!

13:56.590 --> 13:58.140
[Fireball]!

13:59.940 --> 14:01.330
[Multi-Firebolt]!

14:01.800 --> 14:02.940
[Flame]!

14:06.570 --> 14:10.810
Oh, come on! Aren't there a 
few too many monsters here?!

14:10.810 --> 14:12.780
That just proves there's a dungeon nearby!

14:13.350 --> 14:17.000
Oh, another medal! Those guys sure are quick!

14:17.000 --> 14:18.750
We must hurry, as well.

14:19.930 --> 14:20.960
Look!

14:20.960 --> 14:21.950
Over there!

14:25.630 --> 14:28.530
Is that the dungeon entrance?

14:28.530 --> 14:30.190
Should we move closer?

14:30.190 --> 14:33.310
We'll be fine as long as 
Maple's protecting us, right?

14:33.310 --> 14:37.500
I'm scared of what'll happen if something 
uses a piercing attack, though.

14:37.500 --> 14:40.770
If we could just fly straight 
in, that could work, but...

14:40.770 --> 14:43.150
Fly? You mean... on that?

14:43.150 --> 14:46.590
Yep! On this! You can all just grab on!

14:46.590 --> 14:50.360
Wow, that thing can fly, too?

14:51.060 --> 14:52.630
Up we go.

14:52.630 --> 14:57.700
Well, this is convenient. I don't 
see any wings on it, though.

14:57.700 --> 15:00.240
Hold on tight, everyone!

15:00.240 --> 15:02.000
Oh, like this?

15:02.000 --> 15:03.460
L-Like this?

15:03.460 --> 15:05.620
Yep! Sally, do it!

15:05.620 --> 15:06.890
[Web User]!

15:08.480 --> 15:10.640
Okay, all ready, Maple!

15:11.370 --> 15:12.510
Wh-What is this?

15:12.510 --> 15:17.390
Wait, so the thing that dropped from the sky 
on us during the guild competition was—

15:17.390 --> 15:19.340
[Commence Attack]!

15:27.440 --> 15:31.270
We're here! Great job, everyone!

15:32.200 --> 15:36.220
It's not often I encounter a form 
of mobility that I envy <i>less</i>.

15:36.220 --> 15:39.260
Darn it, Sally! I thought 
it'd be like normal flying

15:39.260 --> 15:41.520
'cause you were so calm about it!

15:41.520 --> 15:43.850
I made it so you wouldn't fall, didn't I?

15:43.850 --> 15:46.370
That's <i>not</i> the point here!

15:46.680 --> 15:47.670
Shh!

16:04.320 --> 16:07.590
There it is! A fake Maple!

16:07.590 --> 16:09.720
Huh? M-Me?

16:09.720 --> 16:12.660
I mean, I do get what you're saying...

16:19.200 --> 16:21.090
[Multi-Barrier]!

16:21.090 --> 16:22.570
Notes! [Singing Round]!

16:28.460 --> 16:29.340
It's strong!

16:29.340 --> 16:30.170
Ignis!

16:33.260 --> 16:35.130
Nice one, Mii!

16:35.130 --> 16:36.510
Don't let your guard down.

16:36.510 --> 16:40.560
Maple, why don't you use that 
one skill before the day ends?

16:40.560 --> 16:42.300
Oh, right!

16:42.300 --> 16:43.270
[Atrocity]!

16:51.510 --> 16:54.490
I only have bad memories of that...

16:58.200 --> 17:00.990
They're all armor-piercing!

17:00.990 --> 17:03.210
Ignis! [Undying Inferno]!

17:03.210 --> 17:05.580
On it! [Multi-Pressure]!

17:11.210 --> 17:12.510
[Ice Pillar]!

17:14.510 --> 17:15.990
[Quintuple Slash]!

17:17.930 --> 17:21.470
Sally! Careful you don't get trampled!

17:32.890 --> 17:35.130
Now you've done it!

17:35.130 --> 17:36.860
Payback time!

17:43.580 --> 17:46.750
Maple, you should probably 
get away from it now!

17:53.760 --> 17:54.920
Ow...

17:54.920 --> 17:55.880
Maple!

18:05.640 --> 18:08.350
Whew! I made it out!

18:09.390 --> 18:11.340
Incredible...

18:11.690 --> 18:13.380
Let's finish this right now!

18:13.380 --> 18:16.110
Frederica! Mii! Maple! Get ready!

18:16.110 --> 18:17.290
'Kay!

18:16.490 --> 18:18.490
We're ready at any time!

18:18.490 --> 18:21.000
Syrup, get ready to use [Spirit Cannon]!

18:21.750 --> 18:22.950
Turtle!

18:22.950 --> 18:26.640
Give me a sec! I'll put some buffs on you!

18:28.040 --> 18:29.890
Oboro! [Spirited Away]!

18:31.560 --> 18:32.540
[Super Speed]!

18:35.320 --> 18:37.010
[Pinpoint Attack]!

18:39.970 --> 18:41.720
Maple! Now!

18:41.720 --> 18:43.600
[Deploy Armaments]!

18:43.600 --> 18:45.820
Here's the final touch!

18:45.820 --> 18:47.370
Notes! [Amplify]!

18:48.600 --> 18:50.350
[Karmic Fire of Carnage]!

18:50.350 --> 18:51.810
[Commence Attack]!

18:51.810 --> 18:53.690
Syrup! [Spirit Cannon]!

18:53.690 --> 18:54.500
Turtle!

19:13.040 --> 19:16.340
Good job, everyone! That was a huge success!

19:16.340 --> 19:19.600
Yeah. Seems it went very 
well for your group, too.

19:19.600 --> 19:23.940
It was pretty easy for us since we had Payne.

19:23.940 --> 19:25.720
Everyone was so strong!

19:25.720 --> 19:27.970
That's how we were able to win!

19:28.830 --> 19:31.340
Thanks to all of you who 
stayed at the base, too!

19:31.340 --> 19:32.690
Did it go okay?

19:32.690 --> 19:37.100
Yep! We stayed right here to protect the 
place instead of going after anything!

19:37.100 --> 19:42.700
Yes, of course. We fulfilled 
our duty without incident.

19:44.160 --> 19:46.110
That's great!

19:46.110 --> 19:49.370
We got a ton of medals 
because of all your help!

19:49.370 --> 19:51.120
Thank you so much!

19:51.120 --> 19:54.150
No, we should be thanking you.

19:54.150 --> 19:56.840
Fighting together proved a 
better strategy than I thought.

19:57.690 --> 19:59.920
They got quite a lot of medals.

19:59.920 --> 20:01.120
Yeah.

20:01.120 --> 20:05.390
But if we make the monsters 
stronger than those guys,

20:05.390 --> 20:09.560
other players won't even <i>stand</i> 
a chance of beating them.

20:09.560 --> 20:14.090
They're all on the alert for 
nighttime attacks now, too.

20:14.090 --> 20:15.770
They're so active.

20:15.770 --> 20:19.570
It may be a game, but they should 
at least rest during the night.

20:19.570 --> 20:21.150
So should we, frankly.

20:21.150 --> 20:24.330
You're right, but our problem 
now is the third day.

20:24.330 --> 20:28.660
If they get any additional medals, we'll be 
stuck working overtime even more!

20:29.740 --> 20:31.820
D-Don't worry.

20:31.820 --> 20:34.510
I'm sure <i>that one</i> will serve us well.

20:37.920 --> 20:39.950
Entering day three.

20:39.950 --> 20:45.390
Five, four, three, two, one...

20:40.990 --> 20:43.110
No overtime, please!

20:43.110 --> 20:45.390
No overtime!

20:49.350 --> 20:52.680
Well, it's the third day 
now. What's gonna happen?

20:52.680 --> 20:56.810
It'll probably be even worse 
than the first two days.

20:56.810 --> 20:59.920
We've already got more than 
enough medals, though.

20:59.920 --> 21:03.060
Now we just gotta survive to 
the end, and our goal is met.

21:03.060 --> 21:06.000
We could just lay low in here all day.

21:06.000 --> 21:09.080
Yes. This reminds me of the second event.

21:12.010 --> 21:13.450
Sally, look at that!

21:17.670 --> 21:20.460
That's the gate we went into yesterday!

21:20.460 --> 21:25.050
Maybe those are appearing all over the 
place now that it's the third day.

21:33.450 --> 21:34.710
This is bad.

21:35.100 --> 21:37.570
If a whole group of those attacks us,

21:37.570 --> 21:40.520
keeping everyone alive won't be easy.

21:42.230 --> 21:44.660
It might be dangerous to stay here.

21:45.030 --> 21:47.200
If they corner us, we'll have nowhere to run.

21:47.200 --> 21:52.430
Yes, and I expect even more powerful 
monsters to show up near the end of the event.

21:52.430 --> 21:55.410
I think being flexible in our 
movements would be to our advantage.

21:55.660 --> 21:56.570
Right!

21:57.370 --> 22:01.050
That settles it! This time, 
we're <i>all</i> going on the attack!

22:01.960 --> 22:09.970
[NWO] Eighth Event Day 2, Thread 12 [Those admins are demons]

22:02.150 --> 22:05.990
It's finally the last day!

22:02.730 --> 22:05.920
A lot of people are still alive

22:03.270 --> 22:05.920
Holy Sword, Flame Emperors, and Maple Tree are a given, 
but I guess there are some other strong ones out there, too

22:04.570 --> 22:05.920
But I bet the strongest monsters 
of all will come out on day 3

22:05.530 --> 22:05.920
Even stronger than Atrocity Maple, probably

22:05.920 --> 22:07.040
A lot of people are still alive

22:05.920 --> 22:07.050
